{"version":1,"key":"card:361","content":{"id":361,"content":[{"type":"blockquote","tauContract":"751ccba427a94db9cea481a017ab0a4e94033bd3aa16d3496b70412fe6baf04b","collabId":"a305ad00-5b6b-4631-ad59-2fe2b7993c4f","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3b30bcf9-4881-4e8d-9241-cb60281cd12d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"任何一个人，因为公司的事找到我的话，不管什么事，这个事情就到我为止，不要把事情往外推。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a408f83a-a151-453d-8099-d12a04e024a5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"别人找你，但是这个事情可能不是你负责的，可能常见的作法是你把事情你说这个不是你负责的，是谁谁谁负责，然后就没有了，正确的做法是不论谁找你，这件事应该是到你为止，这件事虽然不是你负责，但是你知道谁负责，那么你可以拉一个群，将问题和同事简单的描述一下，然后就可以了，不需要很多的时间，多做一步，送佛送到西。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ee82fe54-c62c-47d8-99c2-315bb915e8cf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"想到本人的一个案例，之前有一个问题找到我，而我又不知道找谁，先是找了代码的负责人，然后把我推给了产品，产品又给我推给了安全，绕了好几个人我才找到，如果当时它们的心态也是这件事"},{"type":"formatted","color":"#6425d0","darkColor":"#a472fc","text":"到我为止"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么他应该直接拉一个群，然后牵涉方都拉入到群里面，而不是让我一个个去问，那么找人的流程会好很多，我的体验也会好很多。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"88b1370f-87ff-4d5d-acfe-fe95df70d407","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e4e11b89-aa5c-441b-9c9c-72db4b9b7e0f","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"64f2a4b3-f860-4263-b8c9-965f45fde24b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1cfe8684-2241-4476-a657-7803c220d8de","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Pw411C7BC/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"4be288e6-6e2a-4f45-8d20-699d4c39cd8d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"职场大忌：“这事跟我没关系”"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":["技巧/职场"],"createTime":1697501438138,"updateTime":1752924199314,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752924199314}}